<section class="common-page common-space">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                
                <div class="row align-items-center">
<div class="col-md-6">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Buying a </span><b>3 BHK apartment in Faridabad</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> is a long-term decision that depends on space planning, lifestyle features, construction quality, and future value. </span><b>Whispering Heights</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> is designed to meet these expectations by offering spacious homes, modern amenities, and a well-structured residential environment suitable for families and discerning buyers.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This project focuses on practical living rather than compact designs, making it ideal for those who want comfort, privacy, and a balanced lifestyle.</span></p>
<h3><b>About Whispering Heights</b></h3>
<p><b>Whispering Heights</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> is a premium <a href="https://whispering-heights.in/best-residential-projects-in-faridabad/">residential apartment project</a> developed as a well-planned community rather than a high-density complex. Spread across </span><b>8 acres</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, the project consists of </span><b>7 towers with 19 floors</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, ensuring ample open space, better ventilation, and organized living.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The project offers freehold ownership, making it a secure choice for end-users as well as long-term investors. With modern infrastructure, safety systems, and eco-friendly features, Whispering Heights is built to support sustainable urban living.</span></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6">
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-495 size-full" src="https://whispering-heights.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-BHK-Luxury-Apartments-in-Faridabad.jpg" alt="3 BHK Apartments in Faridabad" width="560" height="400" srcset="https://whispering-heights.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-BHK-Luxury-Apartments-in-Faridabad.jpg 560w, https://whispering-heights.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/3-BHK-Luxury-Apartments-in-Faridabad-300x214.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 560px) 100vw, 560px" /></p>
</div>
</div>
<h3><b>Why Choose Whispering Heights for a 3 BHK Home</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When comparing options for a </span><b>3 BHK apartment in Faridabad</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, buyers often look beyond basic specifications. Whispering Heights stands out due to its thoughtful design approach and emphasis on livability.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key reasons include:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Large 1980 sq. ft. apartment size</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, offering openness and comfort</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Clearly defined living, dining, and private zones</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Four balconies</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> that enhance natural light and airflow</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Practical additions like a </span><b>store room</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, rarely available in standard layouts</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Well-planned community with controlled density</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Modern safety, power backup, and eco-conscious infrastructure</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">These factors combine to create a home suitable for long-term family living rather than short-term use.</span></p>
<h3><b>3 BHK Apartment Configuration &amp; Layout Details</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Whispering Heights offers </span><b>3 BHK luxury apartments in Faridabad</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> designed to maximize usable space and everyday functionality. The layout ensures privacy for bedrooms while keeping common areas open and welcoming.</span></p>
<h3><b>Apartment Specifications:</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Area:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 1980 Sq. Ft.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Price:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> ₹1,35,00,000</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Bedrooms:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 3 well-proportioned bedrooms</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Toilets:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 3 modern bathrooms</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Balconies:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 4 spacious balconies</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Kitchen:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 1 functional kitchen with ample working space</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Drawing Room:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Separate drawing room for guests</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Dining Room:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Dedicated dining area</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Store Room:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 1 store room for organized storage</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The apartment layout supports efficient furniture placement, smooth movement between rooms, and a clutter-free lifestyle.</span></p>
<h3><b>Floor Plan &amp; Space Utilization Philosophy</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The floor plan of Whispering Heights emphasizes </span><b>usable carpet area</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, balanced proportions, and privacy. Bedrooms are positioned away from high-traffic areas, while the living and dining zones remain central and accessible.</span></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-517 size-full" src="https://whispering-heights.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-BHK-Apartments-Floor-plan.png" alt="3 BHK Apartments Floor plan" width="650" height="450" srcset="https://whispering-heights.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-BHK-Apartments-Floor-plan.png 650w, https://whispering-heights.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-BHK-Apartments-Floor-plan-300x208.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key space benefits:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Minimal space wastage</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Strong cross-ventilation through multiple balconies</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Natural daylight across rooms</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Practical storage planning</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This makes the apartment suitable for families planning to stay for many years.</span></p>
<h3><b>Lifestyle Amenities That Add Real Value</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Whispering Heights is designed as a complete lifestyle community with amenities that support health, recreation, and social interaction.</span></p>
<h3><b>Amenities Include:</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Badminton Court</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> for indoor sports</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Gymnasium</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> for daily fitness routines</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Swimming Pool</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> for relaxation</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Club House</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> for social and indoor activities</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Kids Play Area</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> designed for safety and engagement</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Meditation &amp; Yoga Area</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> for mental wellness</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Jogging Area</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> for outdoor fitness</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">These amenities enhance everyday living rather than serving as decorative features.</span></p>
<h3><b>Connectivity &amp; Everyday Convenience</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The project enjoys strong connectivity to key commercial, educational, healthcare, and entertainment destinations, making daily life convenient for residents.</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Schools:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> K R Mangalam World School, DPS, Shiv Nadar School, MVN School</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Hospitals:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Amrita Hospital, Yatharth Hospital, Accord Hospital, Metro Hospital</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Retail &amp; Entertainment:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> World Street, Wonder Walk, Pebble Downtown</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Such proximity to essential infrastructure adds to the project’s long-term desirability.</span></p>
<h3><b>Safety, Sustainability &amp; Infrastructure Features</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Whispering Heights incorporates modern safety and eco-friendly systems to ensure a secure and responsible living environment.</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">24×7 security</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Fire fighting systems</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Power backup</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rain water harvesting</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Eco-friendly development</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Landscaped park and canopy walk</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">These features support safety, reliability, and environmental responsibility.</span></p>
<h3><b>Project Highlights at a Glance</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Property Type:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Apartment</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Project Area:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 8 Acres</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Ownership:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Freehold</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>No. of Towers:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 7</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>No. of Floors:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 19</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Parking:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Two-wheeler &amp; four-wheeler parking</span></li>
</ul>
<p><b>RERA No.:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> HRERA-PKL-FBD-141-2019</span></p>
<h3><b>Price &amp; Long-Term Value Perspective</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">At </span><b>₹1.35 crore</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, Whispering Heights offers strong value for buyers comparing a </span><b>3 BHK apartment in Faridabad</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> in the premium segment. The combination of large apartment size, functional layout, lifestyle amenities, and organized community living supports long-term value retention and stable demand.</span></p>
<h3><b>Who Should Buy This Property</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Families</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> looking for a spacious and functional home</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Upgraders</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> moving from smaller apartments</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Professionals</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> seeking comfort, privacy, and amenities</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Investors</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> focused on long-term demand and appreciation</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This project is ideal for buyers who prioritize quality living over compact designs.</span></p>
<h3><b>Enquire About 3 BHK Apartment in Faridabad</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Whispering Heights offers a well-balanced residential option focused on space, comfort, and everyday usability. If you are considering a </span><b>3 BHK apartment in Faridabad</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, this project provides a strong combination of livability and long-term value.</span></p>
